{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"6b95bae8405e9a34a85e5171816a712dbf0dffffa571338deccff3a5ad4a1ebd","ja":"志保のモテるギャップ？","zh":"志保受人欢迎的反差？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"59558e7be9ed1bca99541b2d57d70b8e502b3b98b2fca0956067a0718c0b4014","ja":"それで、どうしてここに来たの？","zh":"所以，你为什么来这里了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d2c857158630c4d84aaa092051c0e9644080b5bd87b4e62e3e3a618f93bbfd82","ja":"ん～、特に決めてないけど、外に出たら、\nなんかヒントがつかめるかな～って！","zh":"嗯～虽然还没特别决定，但想着要是出去走走，\n说不定能找到什么灵感呢～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"bc79376bfdad669bb1bb5fed369b578014bc3f957dccf184c4edfd9629b795fc","ja":"適当ね……。でも翼なら、\nファッションでギャップを狙えるんじゃない？","zh":"真随便啊……不过要是翼的话，\n说不定能靠时尚来制造反差萌呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7b65b6168d8cf6cf6f92c53d5da70ff39a558c185aa00489b9d3ec0bfce465c2","ja":"あ、確かに。ストリート系でかっこよくなったりとか、\nスポーツ系でアクティブ感出したりとか？","zh":"啊，确实。比如走街头风变帅气一些，\n或者走运动风展现出活力感之类的？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"2faacd5245c65c24194c3a1b474ef3991dfcbc0c777d6b0b2f78cc4e37e3548c","ja":"ガーリー系でおもいっきりかわいく攻めたり、\nマニッシュ系で冒険したりするのも楽しいよね♪","zh":"可以走甜美少女风，尽情展现可爱魅力，\n也可以走中性帅气风来场大冒险，都很有意思呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2140735d4221ff90e54fe460bd8dbaba3bb6ecb04fc7041c01f1fc1be9d1ca69","ja":"さすがね。それだけ思いつけるなら、\n十分にギャップを狙えると思うけど。","zh":"真不愧是你。能想到这么多的话，\n我觉得完全可以去主打反差感呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"1c555b1ca8f37fb1f75ac62e2d1600898763c246e417bad25fad3603cc64d198","ja":"うーん……でも、わたしが着たいって思わない\nファッションをしてるのって、違うかも？","zh":"嗯……不过，穿着连我自己都不想穿的\n衣服，或许不太对吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f2d2dd8266d75cc101fa10224004b3e761b309a606e11661d82eaa786a8ba79e","ja":"そんな気持ちで着ちゃったら、服にも失礼だし。","zh":"要是带着这种心情穿上，也太对不起这身衣服了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"dfd968e23e3c3175169f9a9c7ba65193f001fa4f4f1c00be372db03089996091","ja":"……翼って、なんだかんだ言って、\nファッションに対しては、かなり真剣よね。","zh":"……翼这个人，虽说平时那样，\n但对时尚倒是相当认真呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a8d6104ffde3777f00fb665f3c602715325909119b3b85234488d296d36b1cef","ja":"わかったわ。それなら別の方法を考えましょ。","zh":"我知道了。那就考虑别的方法吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"396692d3e61c5aac4474e374b97188d9c21afd01f8b0525c9788d792fffd85bb","ja":"……えへへ♪\n志保ちゃんって、けっこう優しいよね～？","zh":"……嘿嘿♪\n志保其实挺温柔的嘛～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"01d4c306484636b3a8eae4221101f1ce129131a8820c734b3ef866a4102280a3","ja":"え？　何、急に。そんなことないけど。","zh":"咦？怎么这么突然。没有那回事啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"7a7ccab50797fb28b3768763fac79b90d79ef240e4813d76e9c5d8dc32ce125e","ja":"ううん。クールに見えて、\n今日も付き合ってくれてるし……。","zh":"没有啦。虽然看着很酷，\n但今天也还是陪着我呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"526e60afa3d0816ab84be89c4f879fbe393a8ea22a3e844eb110146758fb4f9a","ja":"あっ！　志保ちゃんにも、\nモテるギャップがあるってことだ！？","zh":"啊！也就是说志保身上，\n也有让人心动的反差感咯！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1763.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"05fcadee29edd8d511b95594cacaf4fcae7839835e16eaa1865eacfbdbf0e9a6","ja":"……もう。\nほら、違う場所にも行ってみましょ。","zh":"……真是的。\n走吧，我们也去别的地方看看吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
